mdb.org/t/p/original/l1qPlsCja7RCUPK833MubiRfFLp.jpg"},{"id":2103797,"name":"Mohamed Souda","role":"Amin's father"},{"id":1165293,"name":"David Ribeiro","role":"Fernando","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/19VUFkqzt7hYWFCpgKkHttimvRK.jpg"},{"id":2103799,"name":"Lydia Bouchali-Zemmour","role":"Lamia"},{"id":2103800,"name":"Thomas Fessard","role":"Thomas"},{"id":2103801,"name":"Sième Miladi","role":"Sieme","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c8KqYaJw723h6ePRNxkdaEhUrV0.jpg"},{"id":2103802,"name":"Christophe Brodu","role":"Ophélie's father","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yOfw4CesZg6YuBSHx9xAMgkjgVd.jpg"},{"id":2103804,"name":"Charlotte Jude","role":"Ophélie's sister"},{"id":2103805,"name":"Lyse Warin","role":"Ophélie's cousin"},{"id":1880945,"name":"Estefania Argelich","role":"Spanish Girl","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dEfGPlhEMHFLtWIVNMZ77uphZE0.jpg"},{"id":3784651,"name":"Sarah Jague","role":"Sarah la serveuse","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uYc1pu3kXgTY18TLjaRuOMweAAM.jpg"},{"id":2770745,"name":"Marie Bernard","role":"Girl in Nightclub (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jaofB1JU4zTL6pge2qkgdMp0Bjl.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Mektoub, My Love - Canto Uno","overview":"Amin, un aspirante sceneggiatore che vive a Parigi, ritorna per l’estate nella sua città natale, una comunità di pescatori nel sud della Francia. Accompagnato da suo cugino Tony e dalla sua migliore amica Ophélie, Amin passa il suo tempo tra il ristorante di specialità tunisine dei suoi genitori, i bar del quartiere e la spiaggia frequentata dalle ragazze in vacanza. Incantato dalle numerose figure femminili che lo circondano, Amin resta soggiogato da queste sirene estive, all’opposto del suo dionisiaco cugino che si getta senza remore nell’euforia dei loro corpi. Amin porta avanti la sua ricerca filosofica lanciandosi nella scrittura delle sue sceneggiature."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Amin, an aspiring screenwriter living in Paris, returns home for the summer, in Sète, South of France. It is a time of reconnecting with his family and his childhood friends. Together with his cousin Tony and his best friend Ophélie, he spends his time between the Tunisian restaurant run by his parents, the local bars and the beaches frequented by girls on holiday.","tagline":"For love, only Mektoub can decide."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Amin, un écrivain en herbe habitant Paris, retourne en été dans le Midi de la France où il a passé sa jeunesse chez ses parents qui tiennent un restaurant tunisien à Sète. Il retrouve sa famille et ses amis de jeunesse, comme son cousin dragueur Tony ou sa meilleure amie Ophélie ; il passe son temps entre le restaurant familial, les bars du coin et la plage où viennent bronzer de jolies vacancières. Alors que Tony a du succès, Amin est plutôt timide. Il se trouve une occupation en photographiant la côte méditerranéenne dont il trouve la lumière fascinante et cherche l'inspiration de ses films futurs.","tagline":"En amour, seul le Mektoub décide."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4uMLHyNPpRSoRk9NxsxWaFvkRJv.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jyvbxKsmIIYTQsjOCjnRYWyUEsa.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":337676,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4uMLHyNPpRSoRk9NxsxWaFvkRJv.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4uMLHyNPpRSoRk9NxsxWaFvkRJv.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4uMLHyNPpRSoRk9NxsxWaFvkRJv.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4uMLHyNPpRSoRk9NxsxWaFvkRJv.jpg","language"